{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do you get when Candy Crush meets Slay The Spire? MatchMorphosis is a Match-3 meets strategic Roguelike. Don't let the easy interface fool you, it is tough. <br>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategy Over Speed</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/extras/345cb17063ae995c2870246461b3f055.poster.avif?t=1762249997\" width=256 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/extras/345cb17063ae995c2870246461b3f055.webm?t=1762249997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/extras/345cb17063ae995c2870246461b3f055.mp4?t=1762249997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers. No pressure. Just pure tactical decision-making. Every match matters, every combination counts. Study the board, calculate your moves, and execute devastating combos. All the information you need is right there\u2014victory comes from outsmarting the system, not outpacing it.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Unstoppable Synergies </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/extras/c22119bf0cbde4a55500a38e5d1a2324.poster.avif?t=1762249997\" width=1170 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/extras/c22119bf0cbde4a55500a38e5d1a2324.webm?t=1762249997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/extras/c22119bf0cbde4a55500a38e5d1a2324.mp4?t=1762249997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Discover lots of unique character archetypes, each offering distinct playstyles. Collect from a pool of 50+ tile types, 75+ artifacts, and 30+ perks. The real power isn't in any single item\u2014it's in how you combine them. Chain effects, trigger cascades, and create long lasting combos, all within manageable numbers; let your brain do the math, not a calculator.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Runs with Endless Depth</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/extras/2ee81775453161e1ce7df1037573faea.poster.avif?t=1762249997\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/extras/2ee81775453161e1ce7df1037573faea.webm?t=1762249997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/extras/2ee81775453161e1ce7df1037573faea.mp4?t=1762249997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Every run presents fresh challenges through randomized encounters and branching paths. Face strategic challenges that demand adaptation, not memorization. Navigate through dangerous place, discover hidden synergies, and build your perfect combination. The game respects your intelligence\u2014minimal tutorials, maximum discovery.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Die, Learn, Evolve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/extras/5fbb6ea3eb4f430289230add499c9587.poster.avif?t=1762249997\" width=284 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/extras/5fbb6ea3eb4f430289230add499c9587.webm?t=1762249997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/extras/5fbb6ea3eb4f430289230add499c9587.mp4?t=1762249997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Failure is inevitable. Victory is earned. Each defeat teaches you new strategies, and reveals hidden synergies. No grinding required\u2014unlockables fundamentally change how you approach each run, offering genuinely new experiences rather than mere stat boosts. Your humanity may fade with each reality-warping match, but your skill grows eternal.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4131100?t=1762249997","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4131100?t=1762249997","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/901670f6dca3f0a1f5cb3c65102276c45313b2eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762249997","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/901670f6dca3f0a1f5cb3c65102276c45313b2eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762249997","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do you get when Candy Crush meets Slay The Spire? MatchMorphosis is a Match-3 meets strategic Roguelike. Don't let the easy interface fool you, it is tough. <br>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategy Over Speed</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/extras/345cb17063ae995c2870246461b3f055.poster.avif?t=1762249997\" width=256 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131100/extras/345cb1